# 本目录直接文件说明

仅列出本目录文件；子目录内容请查看对应目录中的 `tree`。

- `accounts.rs` — Account and opening-balance use cases.
- `backup.rs` — Explicit consent backup use cases, typed archive and persistence/codec ports.
- `classification.rs` — Category management and explainable classification rules.
- `lib.rs` — Application service module declarations.
- `mobile.rs` — Mobile application facade for ledger CRUD, pending workflows, filters, settings, reports, and import confirmation.
- `ports.rs` — Repository ports used by application services.
- `reports.rs` — Income, expense, and balance report queries.
- `transactions.rs` — Transaction confirmation and balance use cases.
- `tree` — 本目录直接文件的说明索引。
